1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,901
It's time to brush our teeth!

2
00:00:03,451 --> 00:00:05,306
Sing along with us!

3
00:00:06,656 --> 00:00:08,411
Here's my toothbrush,

4
00:00:08,411 --> 00:00:09,801
here's my paste.

5
00:00:10,101 --> 00:00:11,253
A tiny bit,

6
00:00:11,253 --> 00:00:13,064
not too much waste!

7
00:00:14,164 --> 00:00:15,535
Squeeze a dot,

8
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:17,229
as small as a pea.

9
00:00:17,529 --> 00:00:20,372
Ready to brush, one, two, three!

10
00:00:21,472 --> 00:00:22,690
Brush, brush,

11
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:24,214
brush your teeth!

12
00:00:24,514 --> 00:00:27,457
Brush, brush, sparkly clean!

13
00:00:28,557 --> 00:00:30,400
Brush the top teeth,

14
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,601
up and down.

15
00:00:31,901 --> 00:00:33,442
Brush the bottom,

16
00:00:33,442 --> 00:00:34,905
round and round!

17
00:00:36,005 --> 00:00:39,030
Brush the front and brush the back.

18
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,558
Shiny teeth,

19
00:00:40,558 --> 00:00:41,951
that's a fact!

20
00:00:43,051 --> 00:00:44,269
Brush, brush,

21
00:00:44,269 --> 00:00:45,793
brush your teeth!

22
00:00:46,093 --> 00:00:49,036
Brush, brush, sparkly clean!

23
00:00:50,136 --> 00:00:52,797
Spit it out and rinse away.

24
00:00:53,097 --> 00:00:55,819
Clean teeth for a happy day!

25
00:00:56,919 --> 00:00:59,802
Now give me a great big smile!

26
00:01:00,102 --> 00:01:03,267
Brush two times a day, every day!

27
00:01:04,367 --> 00:01:05,586
Brush, brush,

28
00:01:05,586 --> 00:01:07,109
brush your teeth!

29
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:10,353
Brush, brush, sparkly clean!

30
00:01:11,453 --> 00:01:13,691
Great job, little learner!

31
00:01:14,241 --> 00:01:16,129
Share Mimzi with a friend,

32
00:01:16,129 --> 00:01:18,669
and subscribe for more learning fun!

33
00:01:19,219 --> 00:01:20,327
Next time,

34
00:01:20,327 --> 00:01:22,627
a sweet bedtime lullaby.

35
00:01:22,877 --> 00:01:24,247
Bye bye!
